{
    "title": "Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt",
    "description": "Are you ready to dive into the most captivating hidden object game right now?\r\n\r\nThis is arguably the most addictive FREE hidden object game this winter! Step into a world of happy and enjoyable feelings with \"Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt!\" Immerse yourself in the magic of Christmas as you embark on a holiday-themed scavenger hunt with lively and interactive maps. :)\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Features:\r\n\ud83d\udc97 Enjoy the pleasure of playing hidden object games for free! \r\n\ud83d\udc97 Relax with the best Finding game anywhere, anytime!\r\n\ud83d\udc97 Simple gameplay and rules. Observe the scene, find hidden objects, and complete the scene!\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Suitable for all age groups. Play the picture puzzle game with your friends and family members.\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Various difficulties. The more hidden objects you discover, the more intricate maps you can challenge.\r\n\ud83c\udf33 Powerful tools. Use helpful hints when you get stuck in finding the hidden object.\r\n\ud83c\udf1e Zoom feature. Zoom in and out at any moment to spot well-hidden objects!\r\n\ud83c\udf1e Multiple scenes and levels. Play in the playground, animal park, and ocean world, and explore more destinations.\r\n\r\nAre you ready for some real and fun challenges? All you have to do is simply focus on the listed items, identify and tap on the hidden objects, and complete the tasks. Test your skills and solve the hidden objects puzzles as quickly!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Christmas Detective Fun:\r\nBe a holiday detective and find hidden things in a winter wonderland! Explore festive scenes and solve mysteries.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Fun Christmas Maps:\r\nCheck out cool Christmas scenes with interactive stuff. From cozy fireplaces to busy holiday markets, every map is full of Christmas fun!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf81 Find Hidden Stuff:\r\nDiscover all kinds of hidden things in cute Christmas scenes. Sharpen your eyes and enjoy the holiday surprises!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Play Anywhere, Anytime:\r\nHave a blast with \"Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt\" for FREE! Play it whenever, wherever\u2014perfect for waiting or just a holiday escape!\r\n\r\n\r\nDownload \"Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt\" now and embark on a magical Christmas quest filled with hidden objects, festive challenges, and the spirit of the season. Unwrap the joy of Christmas and experience the best in holiday-themed hidden object games! \ud83c\udf81",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you ready to dive into the most captivating hidden object game right now?<br><br>This is arguably the most addictive FREE hidden object game this winter! Step into a world of happy and enjoyable feelings with &quot;Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt!&quot; Immerse yourself in the magic of Christmas as you embark on a holiday-themed scavenger hunt with lively and interactive maps. :)<br><br>\ud83c\udfae Features:<br>\ud83d\udc97 Enjoy the pleasure of playing hidden object games for free! <br>\ud83d\udc97 Relax with the best Finding game anywhere, anytime!<br>\ud83d\udc97 Simple gameplay and rules. Observe the scene, find hidden objects, and complete the scene!<br>\ud83c\udf33 Suitable for all age groups. Play the picture puzzle game with your friends and family members.<br>\ud83c\udf33 Various difficulties. The more hidden objects you discover, the more intricate maps you can challenge.<br>\ud83c\udf33 Powerful tools. Use helpful hints when you get stuck in finding the hidden object.<br>\ud83c\udf1e Zoom feature. Zoom in and out at any moment to spot well-hidden objects!<br>\ud83c\udf1e Multiple scenes and levels. Play in the playground, animal park, and ocean world, and explore more destinations.<br><br>Are you ready for some real and fun challenges? All you have to do is simply focus on the listed items, identify and tap on the hidden objects, and complete the tasks. Test your skills and solve the hidden objects puzzles as quickly!<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Christmas Detective Fun:<br>Be a holiday detective and find hidden things in a winter wonderland! Explore festive scenes and solve mysteries.<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Fun Christmas Maps:<br>Check out cool Christmas scenes with interactive stuff. From cozy fireplaces to busy holiday markets, every map is full of Christmas fun!<br><br>\ud83c\udf81 Find Hidden Stuff:<br>Discover all kinds of hidden things in cute Christmas scenes. Sharpen your eyes and enjoy the holiday surprises!<br><br>\ud83d\udd0d Play Anywhere, Anytime:<br>Have a blast with &quot;Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt&quot; for FREE! Play it whenever, wherever\u2014perfect for waiting or just a holiday escape!<br><br><br>Download &quot;Hidden Folks: Scavenger Hunt&quot; now and embark on a magical Christmas quest filled with hidden objects, festive challenges, and the spirit of the season. Unwrap the joy of Christmas and experience the best in holiday-themed hidden object games! \ud83c\udf81",
